00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:49.950
So they (laughing)

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:52.051
- Yeah their bodies, our bodies.

00:09:52.051 --> 00:09:53.230
Yeah.

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:55.840
- I once, for kicks, put a step
tracker on my five year old

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:59.000
and saw what happened and he
