00:18:34.183 --> 00:18:35.320
And so, I do wanna make a distinction

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:38.330
that was a great question
Camilla for a little plug here

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:41.010
for Shape America is
just that distinguishing

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:44.440
between physical activity
and physical education

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:46.670
so physical activity is just movement,

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:49.870
and any kinda movement where
you're expending energy.

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:51.570
But physical education is really important

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:52.870
and especially health education

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:55.940
and I think we can really
see it in this moment

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:58.540
is that, were, there are
standards and objectives

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:01.870
that go along with actual
learning and physical education.

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:05.020
So, I've heard a lot of stories
of, I'll give you example,

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:08.670
of people who were athletes in school,

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:11.210
and their coaches were
telling them what to do

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:12.820
but as soon as they lost that coach,

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:15.475
they were no longer involved
in that sport, they no longer,

00:19:15.475 --> 00:19:19.200
they found themselves they
didn't know how to actually take

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:21.070
that, what I keep talking
about that ownership

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:23.060
of how to take care of their health

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:24.310
and their wellness

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:26.830
and so with health and physical education,

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:28.560
it's teaching them those skills

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:31.400
so that when they do, are an adult.

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:33.390
They know how to be physically active,

00:19:33.390 --> 00:19:34.540
they have the skills

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:37.210
so that they can be physically
active for a lifetime.

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:40.080
They do have the skills to
take care of their mental

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:42.080
and emotional health as well.

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:44.690
And so we see it's very
important right now

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:46.880
because we're at home.

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:48.650
And so we're finding challenges

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:51.170
of being physically active
we're also finding challenges

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:52.928
of taking care of our, our emotional

00:19:52.928 --> 00:19:55.500
and our mental well being as well.

